  '    ["Cardi Nusantara membangun brand yang dipercaya. Cardi Agent AI membantu tim Anda mengelola prospek, menindaklanjuti penjualan, dan membuat pelanggan kembali.", "Cardi Nusantara builds trusted brands. Cardi Agent AI helps your team manage leads, follow up on sales, and keep customers coming back.", "Cardi Nusantara 打造值得信赖的品牌。Cardi Agent AI 帮助您的团队管理潜在客户、跟进销售并提升客户复购率。"],',
